 "title": "Curiosity's 14th Martian Year",
 "cat": "space",
 "emoji": "🤖",
 "sentences": [
  "Curiosity is 14 years old on Mars!",
  "The rover celebrated by climbing Mount Sharp at a 24-degree tilt.",
  "It used its robotic arm to measure a target called Tunas Khasa.",
  "Special cameras snapped giant rock mosaics to study ancient winds.",
  "ChemCam also targeted nodular rocks formed by water.",
  "After a 14-meter drive, the robot is ready to solve more Martian puzzles."
 ],
